\u00d7 revenue per employee (very high relative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags elevated compensation governance risk (9/10).","financial_summary":["Camden Property Trust is a mid-cap real estate business with a $9.9B market cap on $13M of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +36% over the past three years and -35% annually across the full decade, the kind of sustained demand persistence that marks a compounder.","The business throws off $824M in free cash flow \u2014 roughly 6356 cents on every revenue dollar, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders, and cash conversion sits at 2.15\u00d7 so those profits are backed by real cash.","On the balance sheet, debt is heavy at 6.3\u00d7 net debt/EBITDA, and leverage like that is what turns a bad year into a permanent loss, and interest coverage runs at 3.8\u00d7.","Management returns a meaningful 7.4% of market cap to owners through dividends and buybacks, a strong signal of disciplined capital allocation, and stock-based comp at 131% of revenue is silent dilution an owner has to account for, and insider ownership is negligible, so management has little personal stake in the long-term outcome."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (1.3) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Above-average short interest at 6.8% of float","sev":"amber","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Significant insider selling (net $4.0M)","sev":"amber","cat":"insider","dollars":-3972716.68},{"text":"Interest-rate sensitivity and tenant-credit risk \u2014 cap rates and refinancing costs move faster than the 10-year leases can absorb.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Remote work structural vacancy \u2014 the post-pandemic shift to hybrid work has permanently impaired demand for urban office space across most markets.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Climate and insurance cost escalation \u2014 rising premiums and coverage withdrawals in flood/fire zones are repricing assets that the market once treated as perpetuities.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Trading at a 34% margin of safety to estimated fair value \u2014 a real cushion against errors in the estimate","Market is pricing in lower growth than the company has historically delivered","Trading near the bottom of its 52-week range \u2014 the market is offering a discount","32 consecutive years of dividend payments \u2014 an operating record that makes the dividend claim credible","Healthy payout ratio leaves room for both dividend growth and reinvestment","Growing faster than most Real Estate peers \u2014 taking share inside the profit pool"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Camden Property Trust $CPT Stock: Fulcrum Asset Management LLP Increases Stake","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/13/camden-property-trust-cpt-stock-fulcrum-asset-management-llp-increases-stake.html","date":"2026-11-13","timestamp":1794563109.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.968,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Olympus Announces CMS Valuation and Reimbursement Rates for New ESD CPT Codes","source":"prnewswire.com","link":"https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/olympus-announces-cms-valuation-and-reimbursement-rates-for-new-esd-cpt-codes-302938339.html","date":"2026-11-12","timestamp":1794512580.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.649,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Camden Property Trust $CPT Stock: New York Life Investment Management LLC Boosts Holdings","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/12/camden-property-trust-cpt-stock-new-york-life-investment-management-llc-boosts-holdings.html","date":"2026-11-12","timestamp":1794479241.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.95,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Camden Property Trust (NYSE:CPT) Given New $107.00 Price 